<link rel="stylesheet" href="/user/css/about.css" />

<section class="section hero-about reveal">
    <div class="container hero-about-inner">
        <p class="band-label">SINCE 2020</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">OUR STORY</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">Born from a passion for sneaker culture — built for every stride</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section about-mission-section reveal">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-mission-grid">
            <div class="about-mission-left">
                <p class="band-label">WHO WE ARE</p>
                <h2 class="about-mission-title">MORE THAN JUST SHOES</h2>
                <p class="about-mission-text">
                    HOOF was born from a simple belief: the right pair of sneakers can change the way
                    you move through the world. What started as a small passion project in 2020 has
                    grown into a community of sneaker enthusiasts who value quality, authenticity,
                    and self-expression.
                </p>
                <p class="about-mission-text">
                    We curate the finest collections from over 500 brands worldwide, hand-picking
                    every pair to ensure it meets our high standards. Whether you're hitting the
                    streets, the track, or the office — we've got the perfect pair waiting for you.
                </p>
                <a href="/user/shop" class="about-cta-btn">
                    Explore Collection <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="about-mission-right">
                <div class="about-quote-card">
                    <div class="about-quote-badge">
                        <i class="fas fa-star"></i> Premium Quality
                    </div>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shoe-prints about-quote-icon"></i>
                    <h3 class="about-quote-text">"Step Into Something Greater"</h3>
                    <p class="about-quote-tagline">Crafted with care. Worn with confidence.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section about-stats-section reveal">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-stats-grid">
            <div class="about-stat-card">
                <span class="about-stat-number" data-target="500" data-suffix="+">0</span>
                <span class="about-stat-label">Brands</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stat-card">
                <span class="about-stat-number" data-target="10" data-suffix="K+">0</span>
                <span class="about-stat-label">Customers</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stat-card">
                <span class="about-stat-number" data-target="50" data-suffix="K+">0</span>
                <span class="about-stat-label">Pairs Sold</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stat-card">
                <span class="about-stat-number" data-target="4.9" data-suffix="★" data-decimal="true">0</span>
                <span class="about-stat-label">Rating</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section about-values-section reveal">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <p class="band-label">WHAT DRIVES US</p>
            <h2>OUR VALUES</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">The principles that guide every step we take</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-values-grid">
            <div class="about-value-card">
                <div class="about-value-icon"><i class="fas fa-gem"></i></div>
                <h3>Quality</h3>
                <p>Every pair is handpicked and inspected to meet our exacting standards. We never compromise on
                    materials, craftsmanship, or comfort.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-value-card">
                <div class="about-value-icon"><i class="fas fa-certificate"></i></div>
                <h3>Authenticity</h3>
                <p>100% genuine products, always. We work directly with brands and authorized distributors to guarantee
                    authenticity on every purchase.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-value-card">
                <div class="about-value-icon"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div>
                <h3>Community</h3>
                <p>More than a store — we're a movement. Join thousands of sneakerheads who share a passion for style,
                    culture, and self-expression.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section about-team-section reveal">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <p class="band-label">THE CREW</p>
            <h2>MEET THE TEAM</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">The people behind the sneakers you love</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-team-grid">
            <div class="about-team-card">
                <div class="about-team-avatar">RK</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-name">Rabeeh Khan</h3>
                <span class="about-team-role">Founder & CEO</span>
                <p class="about-team-bio">A lifelong sneaker enthusiast who turned a passion into a brand. Rabeeh leads
                    the vision and culture at HOOF.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-team-card">
                <div class="about-team-avatar">AS</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-name">Aisha Sharma</h3>
                <span class="about-team-role">Creative Director</span>
                <p class="about-team-bio">With an eye for trends and a love for design, Aisha curates every collection
                    to ensure it's fresh, bold, and on-point.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-team-card">
                <div class="about-team-avatar">NR</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-name">Nikhil Raj</h3>
                <span class="about-team-role">Head of Operations</span>
                <p class="about-team-bio">Nikhil keeps everything running smoothly — from warehouse to doorstep. Speed
                    and reliability are his obsession.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

